  "goodToKnow": "Verstreut means scattered: verstreute Häuser, über die ganze Welt verstreut. It's the participle of verstreuen (to scatter): Asche verstreuen (scattering ashes is largely not allowed in Germany outside special areas). Streuen means to sprinkle or spread, as in Salz streuen or icy pavements that must be gestreut by homeowners. Zerstreut means absent-minded: der zerstreute Professor."
